1
00:00:00,147 --> 00:00:01,317
(Penny:)- Mom still here?
- Yep.

2
00:00:01,481 --> 00:00:02,811
(Penny:)Come on in.

3
00:00:04,192 --> 00:00:06,532
(Penny:)She's not gonna come here
looking for you, is she?

4
00:00:06,695 --> 00:00:10,115
(Leonard:)Oh, relax. She took Sheldon to the hospital
to get a brain scan.

5
00:00:10,282 --> 00:00:12,662
- Oh, my God. What happened?
- Nothing.

6
00:00:12,826 --> 00:00:16,996
(Leonard:)Mother likes looking at brains
and Sheldon likes getting his brain scanned.

7
00:00:18,039 --> 00:00:19,499
Jeez, what a fun couple.

8
00:00:19,666 --> 00:00:22,126
Ugh. She's only here a day and a half...

9
00:00:22,294 --> 00:00:26,464
(Leonard:)...and I'm seriously considering alcoholism
as a new career path.

10
00:00:26,631 --> 00:00:30,511
(Penny:)I talked to her for five minutes yesterday
and I've been half bombed ever since.

11
00:00:31,678 --> 00:00:33,508
(Leonard:)You can't let her get into your head.

12
00:00:33,680 --> 00:00:36,220
- My head, what about yours?
- It's too late for me.

13
00:00:36,391 --> 00:00:38,931
(Leonard:)My head is her summer house.

14
00:00:41,021 --> 00:00:42,191
(Penny:)She was right, you know.

15
00:00:42,355 --> 00:00:45,525
(Penny:)The locus of my identity
is totally exterior to me.

16
00:00:45,692 --> 00:00:47,982
(Leonard:)Oh, yeah, there she is. Hi, mom.

17
00:00:50,655 --> 00:00:52,365
(Penny:)Do you know where I was all morning?

18
00:00:52,532 --> 00:00:56,832
(Penny:)Auditioning with 50 other blondes
for some stupid antidepressant commercial.

19
00:00:56,995 --> 00:01:01,025
(Penny:)And for what?
So I'll finally get my daddy's approval?

